title: Reichsexecution
new-page: true
tags: pres_affairs
is-card: true
card-image: img/reichsexekution.jpg

With the Presidency, we have the power to depose any state government through a *Reichsexekution.* More cynically, it also offers an opportunity to enforce our power at the state level. We must reserve these powers for serious cases where the extreme parties have entered government, however.

- @reichsexecute_hamburg
- @reichsexecute_saxony
- @reichsexecute_thuringia
- @reichsexecute_bavaria
- @reichsexecute_prussia
- @reichsexecute_wurttemburg
- @reichsexecute_schaumburg_lippe
- @root

@reichsexekute_hamburg
choose-if: in_hamburg_uspd = 1 or in_hamburg_dnvp = 1 or in_hamburg_nsdap = 1
unavailable-subtitle: There are no extreme parties within this government.
tags: reichsexekutions
title: Reichsexekute Hamburg.
subtitle: This will anger the non-extreme parties of the state government!
on-arrival: in_hamburg_spd = 1; in_hamburg_uspd = 0; in_hamburg_dnvp = 0; in_hamburg_nsdap = 0;

We have performed a *Reichsexekution* against the government of Hamburg, removing it of extremist forces.

